    "intro": "> *\"Darkness does not hide the soul — it reveals it. And in the eclipse, what is revealed can be remade.\"* — Solomon Lev'nali\n\n**Description.** A black sun ringed by seven prismatic coronas hangs in a torn sky; the ground is crystalline hexagons reflecting the eclipse, soul-equations burning across every surface. At the center floats the Soul Crucible, and defeated creatures dissolve into light that streams upward into the dark star. This is the moment between death and rebirth — where darkness reveals truth, and new light is forged from the old.",
