     "cost": 0,
     "action": "Bonus Action",
     "text": "White Rabbit has the **Warding** Ability its warding range its equivalent to 40 ft for each Troop. Each troop can act independently from each other.\n\nAs a **Bonus Action** the Grimm User can command all Troops to each move up their speed and take 1 Action from their Action List. If a Troop says that it uses a Reaction it uses the Troop's reaction.\n\nAs commander of this platoon the Grimm User gains a additional **Bonus Action** to their turn."
