     "cost": 2,
     "action": "Action",
     "text": "As an **Action** the Grimm User expends 2 Grimm slots to enhanced its weapon with a vorpal energy of White Rabbit. The Grimm User's makes 1 weapon attack against a creature, on a hit that attack deals an additional all mighty damage equal twice the Grimm User's Prof. Bonus of d8s and also creates a Critical Window (the critical range its increased by one) for you and all allies, until the end of your next turn.\n\nIf the Attacks misses, the Vorpal Energy remains on the Weapon and the Grimm User can try again with another Action.\n\nIf this Attacks hits with a natural 20 the Critical Window is increased by 3 instead of 1.\n\nA creature can only have 1 Critical Window at the time."
