     "text": "White Rabbit summons an additional troop to the battlefield. As an action, the Grimm User expends a Grimm Slot to summon one additional Troop.\n* The Grimm User can choose to expend additional Grimm Slots during this action to gain the equivalent Reinforcement Troops.\n\t\n* Reinforcement Troops last for 1 minute or until they are dismissed.\n\t\n* The maximum number of Troops cannot exceed twice the Grimm User's proficiency bonus."
