    "intro": "> *\"I was born a weapon, shaped to break. She taught me I could build. No one dies here unless I die first.\"* — Zeke, upon first manifesting Eden\n\n**Description.** Reality gives way to the garden Zeke never had — walls of living vine and crystal thorn, a sky of eternal golden dawn, streams of healing water. It was reforged from six of his failures (Aelia, Family, Identity, Loyalty, First Breath, Brotherhood), and to every soul who stands to protect within it, the garden offers a shard of that same reforging. Here, lies wither and the innocent do not fall — but to raise a hand against them is to be rejected by the world itself.",
