        "text": "*(an ally's turn — that ally shatters their Crystal · Fury).* For the rest of that turn, all damage and healing the ally deals is **maximized**. *(→ 10th: advantage on their attacks · 15th: they crit on 18–20 · 20th: their damage also ignores resistances.)*"
