     "text": "Thanatos offers its Grimm User the ability to walk the line between life and dead. After finishing a long rest, the Grimm User can choose to **sacrifice a Death Saving Throw** (Max. 3), in order to gain a **bonus to its hit points** equivalent to 50% of the current Maximum Hit Points. The Grimm User can choose to sacrifice more than one Death Saving Throw gaining a 100% extra health for two and 150% for three.\n\nThe Grimm User regains the sacrificed Death Saves after finishing a Long Rest which can be sacrificed again. When this ability is used the Grimm User has irrefutable **advantage** on **Death Saving Throws**."
