      "text": "*Flavour and terrain, for describing the place at the table.*\n\n- **Terrain.** A crystalline resonance field — solid to stand on, vibrating at molecular frequencies, every surface subtly blurred.\n- **Sky.** A spiralling vortex of compressed soundwaves in geometric interference patterns, pulsing in time with the Tuning Nexus.\n- **Light.** Refracted through the seven Rings into shifting zones of violet, azure, silver and ultraviolet.\n- **Structures.** The Tuning Nexus at the center, the seven orbital Resonance Rings, and periodic **Echo Pylons** marking zones of accelerated frequency.\n- **The senses.** A constant harmonic hum at the edge of hearing; air pressure shifting against the skin; the taste of ionised air, metallic and electric; temperature swinging ±10 °F every six seconds."
