   "spiritText": "*Huge Replica, Neutral Evil*  \n___\n- **Armor Class** 16 (Natural Armor)  \n- **Hit Points** 150  \n- **Speed** 25 ft.  \n___\n\n| STR     | DEX     | CON     | INT     | WIS     | CHA     |\n|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|\n| 25 (+7) | 8 (-1)  | 26 (+8) | 16 (+3) | 14 (+2) | 18 (+4) |\n___\n\\- **Saving Throws** Str +13, Con +14, Wis +8, Cha +10  \n- **Skills** Intimidation +10, Perception +8  \n- **Damage Resistances** All damage except force and psychic  \n- **Damage Immunities** Poison  \n- **Condition Immunities** Charmed, Frightened, Paralyzed, Poisoned  \n- **Senses** Darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 18  \n- **Languages** Goblin, Undercommon, Terran  \n- **Challenge** 15  \n___\n\n### Regeneration\nThe Diamond King Goblin regains 30 hit points at the start of its turn if it has at least 1 hit point remaining. If the Diamond King Goblin takes radiant damage, this trait doesn’t function at the start of its next turn.\n\n### Actions\n***Multiattack.*** The Diamond King Goblin makes two *Crushing Fist* attacks and one *Psychic Blast* attack.\n\n***Crushing Fist.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +13 to hit, reach 10 ft., one target. *Hit:* 28 (4d8 + 7) bludgeoning damage, and the target must succeed on a DC 20 Strength saving throw or be knocked prone.\n\n***Psychic Blast.*** *Ranged Spell Attack:* +10 to hit, range 60 ft., one target. *Hit:* 40 (8d8) psychic damage, and the target must succeed on a DC 18 Intelligence saving throw or be overwhelmed until the end of their next turn.\n\n***Diamond Burst (Recharge 6).*** The Diamond King Goblin releases a burst of diamond shards in a 30-foot radius centered on itself. Each creature in that area must make a DC 22 Dexterity saving throw, taking 45 (10d8) piercing damage on a failed save, or half as much on a successful one. The area becomes difficult terrain for 1 minute as the shards cover the ground.\n\n***Diamond Shield (1/Day).*** The Diamond King Goblin creates a shimmering shield of diamond energy around itself. Until the end of its next turn, it gains immunity to all damage."
