   "spiritText": "*Medium Replica, Neutral*  \n___\n- **Armor Class** 18 (Plate Armor)  \n- **Hit Points** 65 (10d8 + 20)  \n- **Speed** 30 ft.  \n___\n\n| STR     | DEX     | CON     | INT     | WIS     | CHA     |\n|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|\n| 18 (+4) | 14 (+2) | 14 (+2) | 10 (+0) | 12 (+1) | 10 (+0) |\n___\n- **Saving Throws** Str +6, Dex +4, Con +4  \n- **Skills** Athletics +6, Intimidation +2, Perception +3  \n- **Senses** Passive Perception 13  \n- **Languages** Common  \n- **Challenge** 7  \n___\n\n### Actions\n***Multiattack.*** The Fighter Spirit makes two melee weapon attacks.\n\n***Longsword.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +6 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. *Hit:* 9 (1d10 + 4) slashing damage.\n\n### Battle Maneuvers (3/Short Rest)\nThe Fighter Spirit has a selection of maneuvers it can use, expending one superiority die (1d8) per maneuver.\n\n- ***Parry.*** When another creature damages the Fighter Spirit with a melee attack, it can use its reaction to reduce the damage by 1d8 + 2.\n\n- ***Disarming Attack.*** When the Fighter Spirit hits a creature with a weapon attack, it can attempt to disarm the target. The target must succeed on a DC 14 Strength saving throw or drop one held item of the Fighter Spirit's choice.\n\n- ***Riposte.*** When a creature misses the Fighter Spirit with a melee attack, it can use its reaction to make a melee weapon attack against the creature. If it hits, it adds 1d8 to the attack's damage roll.\n\n### Second Wind (1/Short Rest)\nThe Fighter Spirit can use a bonus action to regain 1d10 + 5 hit points.\n\n### Action Surge (1/Short Rest)\nOn its turn, the Fighter Spirit can take one additional action on top of its regular action and possible bonus action."
