   "spiritText": "*Medium Replica, Neutral*  \n___\n- **Armor Class** 15 (Studded Leather)  \n- **Hit Points** 42 (6d8 + 12)  \n- **Speed** 30 ft.  \n___\n\n| STR     | DEX     | CON     | INT     | WIS     | CHA     |\n|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|\n| 10 (+0) | 18 (+4) | 14 (+2) | 12 (+1) | 13 (+1) | 14 (+2) |\n___\n- **Saving Throws** Dex +7, Int +4  \n- **Skills** Acrobatics +7, Perception +4, Sleight of Hand +7, Stealth +10  \n- **Senses** Passive Perception 14  \n- **Languages** Common, Thieves’ Cant  \n- **Challenge** 7  \n___\n\n***Sneak Attack (1/Turn).*** The Thief Spirit deals an extra 3d6 damage when it hits a target with a weapon attack and has advantage on the attack roll, or when the target is within 5 feet of an ally of the Thief Spirit that isn’t incapacitated and the Thief Spirit doesn’t have disadvantage on the attack roll.\n\n***Fast Hands.*** The Thief Spirit gains an additional bonus action.\n\n***Second-Story Work.*** The Thief Spirit has a climbing speed equal to its walking speed, and when making a running jump, it increases the distance by a number of feet equal to its Dexterity modifier (+4).\n\n### Actions\n***Multiattack.*** The Thief Spirit makes two melee or ranged weapon attacks.\n\n***Shortsword.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +7 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. *Hit:* 8 (1d6 + 4) piercing damage.\n\n***Shortbow.*** *Ranged Weapon Attack:* +7 to hit, range 80/320 ft., one target. *Hit:* 8 (1d6 + 4) piercing damage.\n\n### Bonus Actions\n***Cunning Action.*** The Thief Spirit can take a bonus action on each of its turns to take the Dash, Disengage, or Hide action.\n\n### Reactions\n***Uncanny Dodge.*** When an attacker that the Thief Spirit can see hits it with an attack, it can use its reaction to halve the attack’s damage against it."
