   "spirit": "Sandolian Vulture Spirit",
   "spiritText": "*Large Replica, Unaligned*  \n___\n- **Armor Class** 16 (Natural Armor)  \n- **Hit Points** 97 (13d10 + 26)  \n- **Speed** 10 ft., fly 60 ft.  \n___\n\n| STR     | DEX     | CON     | INT     | WIS     | CHA     |\n|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|:-------:|\n| 18 (+4) | 16 (+3) | 15 (+2) | 6 (-2)  | 12 (+1) | 7 (-2)  |\n___\n- **Saving Throws** Dex +6, Con +5, Wis +4  \n- **Skills** Perception +4, Stealth +6  \n- **Damage Resistances** Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing from Nonmagical Attacks  \n- **Condition Immunities** Frightened  \n- **Senses** Darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 14  \n- **Languages** —  \n- **Challenge** 5  \n___\n\n***Spell Resistance.*** The Sandolian Vulture has advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.\n\n***Magic Feathers.*** When targeted by a spell that deals damage, the Vulture's feathers can deflect some of the magical energy. The Vulture takes only half damage from spells that allow a saving throw.\n\n***Keen Sight and Smell.*** The Vulture has advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks that rely on sight or smell.\n\n### Actions\n***Multiattack.*** The Sandolian Vulture makes two attacks: one with its beak and one with its talons.\n\n***Beak.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +7 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. *Hit:* 13 (2d8 + 4) piercing damage.\n\n***Talons.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +7 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. *Hit:* 15 (2d10 + 4) slashing damage.\n\n### Reactions\n***Feather Guard (1/Turn).*** When the Vulture is targeted by a spell that requires a spell attack roll, it can use its reaction to impose disadvantage on the attack roll. If the attack misses, the Vulture gains 5 temporary hit points."
